"Your ChatGPT and Claude, phone apps included, can read your Sentient knowledge base, making them dramatically more helpful." = "你的 ChatGPT 和 Claude（含手机版）都能读取 Sentient 知识库，让它们变得更有帮助。";
"Sentient built your knowledge base right here on this Mac. Want to offer it to ChatGPT, Claude, and every AI you use?" = "Sentient 通过这台 Mac 建立了你的知识库。想开放给 ChatGPT、Claude 和所有 AI 吗？";
"Your knowledge base is built, private, and yours to explore.\nThe living Sentient uses your ChatGPT Plus:" = "知识库已建成，私密且属于你。\n持续运行的 Sentient 使用你的 ChatGPT Plus：";
"We noticed you're not on ChatGPT Plus." = "你尚未订阅 ChatGPT Plus。";
"Sentient will unlock the full experience and take your word for it.\n\nNote that the ChatGPT Go plan does not offer enough Codex use to unlock the full experience." = "Sentient 将解锁完整体验。\n\n注意：ChatGPT Go 计划不提供足够的 Codex 额度。";
"Sentient's on-device model does about 90% of the thinking. The last 10%, the reasoning behind proactive intelligence, runs on a frontier model of your choice." = "Sentient 本地模型处理约 90% 的思考。最后 10% 的主动智能推理运行在自选前沿模型上。";
"Runs while your Mac rests." = "在你的 Mac 休眠时运行。";
